{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ClimaxVolumeMass.SelectionRuleAnchorsC1C3","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ClimaxVolumeMass.SelectionRuleAnchorsC1C3","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic","lean:module:QOU.Mass.QHookDimension","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Cast","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_anchor_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_anchor_derived","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3.lean#L122-L127","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3","label":"prop:selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_anchor_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_anchor_derived","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3.lean#L117-L120","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_eq_family_a","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_eq_family_a","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3.lean#L95-L103","doc":"**Composite c=3 anchor** — the Family-A linking_weight equals the\nselection-rule average at H_4, in the `h`-form expected by PR #1765:\n\n`lw(3) = 5/2 + (3/4)·(q − q⁻¹)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.family_a_q_form_eq_h_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.family_a_q_form_eq_h_form","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3.lean#L83-L93","doc":"**Family-A in `h` form** — `(3q² + 4 + 3q⁻²)/4 = 5/2 + (3/4) h²`\nwhere `h := q - q⁻¹`.\n\nUses the standard identity `q² + q⁻² = h² + 2`, then `field_simp; ring`\nclears the `q⁻¹` denominators and matches the polynomial form. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_eq_family_a_q_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c3_eq_family_a_q_form","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3.lean#L64-L81","doc":"**c=3 anchor (proton)** — Family-A: the average of the five\nq-dimensions of `H_4` partitions equals `(3q² + 4 + 3q⁻²)/4`.\n\nSubstituting the explicit q-hook values:\n  `(1 + (q² + 1 + q⁻²) + (q² + q⁻²) + (q² + 1 + q⁻²) + 1) / 4\n     = (3q² + 4 + 3q⁻²) / 4`.\n\nBoth sides are written here as explicit Laurent polynomials in `q`;\nthe identity is a pure ring computation after clearing `q⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_eq_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.selection_rule_c1_eq_one","kind":"theorem","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/selection-rule-anchors-c1-c3.lean#L52-L62","doc":"**c=1 anchor (muon)** — the average of the two q-dimensions of `H_2`\nis exactly 1, at every `q` and over any base field.\n\n`(1/2) · ( dim_q V_{(2)} + dim_q V_{(1,1)} ) = (1/2)(1 + 1) = 1`.\n\nThe `q` argument is retained for uniformity with the c=3 anchors but is\ngenuinely unused: both `H_2` q-dimensions are the constant 1, so the\nstatement carries no `q` at all. ","signatureChunk":0}]}